window.products.push({"id":747133,"name":"BEL AVENIR 2 Pack Curtain Holdbacks Metal Round Medallion Drapery Tiebacks Wall Hooks Modern Simple Style Home Decor with 2pcs Screws (Bronze)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m-dMvGxwS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Prefect Size: Size of round holdback is 2.36*3 inch. Made of alloy, which durable and metallic luster. Package:come with a pair of metal holderbacks and 2pcs screws. Modern simple style suitable for decor living room, bedroom,office, restaurant, hotel and so on. Now let me tell you how to assemble the holdback and install the screws. First drill the handle into the round top cover (to prevent loosening, the hole is slightly smaller), And then drill the screw into the bottom of the holdback. Next make a suitable hole in the wall with a drill. Then hit the expansion tube into the hole with a hammer, And then hook into the expansion screw hole, the installation is completes. Multiple usages: It can be used as curtain holdback, suitable for ordinary curtain, heavy curtain, sheer curtain. Also can be used with rope tieback or tassel tieback, as a hook. Or as a decorative hook for home, used for hanging clothes or decorations. Customer's satisfaction is always our main priority.Please feel free to contact us with any questions or concerns you may have. BEL AVENIR will reply you in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m-dMvGxwS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEL AVENIR","source_asin":"B09DPJTS5G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-747133","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DPJTS5G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DPJTS5G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":747134,"name":"Maher Customs Chicken Roasting Rack Stainless Steel-Patented Design Chicken Roaster Stand Rack for Pans, Oven, Smoker, or BBQ Use- Non Stick Dishwashe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41e7ukNOGPL._AC_.jpg","description":"Page Title My First Heading My first paragraph. This product will come with a detailed recipe for roasted chicken along with instructions on how to use the product. The instructions also provide access to an how-to video showing how to roast or BBQ a chicken with your Maher Customs Roasting Rack. We recommend using a disposable roasting pan with the rack but this can also be used with traditional roasting pans as well. The rack was invented by Tim Maher who was inspired by beer can chicken roasters and expensive rotisserie chicken roasting machines. His goal was to create a cost effective rack for roasting chicken that held the chicken well above the grease and fat while cooking. He wanted to create a rack that was not only a good roasting rack for oven use but also a roasting rack for the smoker and bbq chicken roasting that wasn't very time consuming to clean. At the time of the invention most roasting racks were the vertical design and made with inexpensive materials and some were extremely difficult to clean. The rack dimensions being (8 inches(L) x 5.5 inches (W) x 7.5 inches (H) ) this is typically considered a small roasting rack that can hold up to and 8 pound chicken effectively and can typically handle any chicken purchased at a grocery store. You will receive one electro polished food grade stainless steel roaster rack. Which means the wire used to make the metal roasting rack will not transfer to the meat like many inexpensive vertical roasters. The Lemon Chicken Roasting Rack was designed to cook healthy rotisserie style roasted chicken in your own oven. The rack holds the chicken up allowing grease to fall into the tray. This will lower the consumption of fat for you and your family when cooking a chicken with the rack. The heat from the oven will cook the whole chicken on all sides which leaves a crispy skin all the way around the chicken. This is some seriously good chicken. You can also place a lemon, or any other desired fruit or vegetable, in the middle of the chicken on the designated spear, allowing you to experiment with different flavors “If this is not the best roasting rack you have used I encourage you to use our 100 % Money Back Guarantee” -Tim Maher (Inventor of the Chicken Roasting Rack and CEO of Maher Customs)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41e7ukNOGPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maher Customs","source_asin":"B01LWZPS1Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-747134","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LWZPS1Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LWZPS1Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":747135,"name":"Contigo SnapSeal Kenton Travel Mugs, 20 oz, Polar White & Monaco, 2-Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yqQmkRBGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a leak-proof day with the Contigo SnapSeal kenton vacuum-insulated stainless steel travel mug, 20oz. The lid's SnapSeal technology is designed for an easy, one-handed drinking experience, even during your morning commute. Pop the top to drink your caffeinated beverage of choice. There's no lid to unscrew or remove. Just make sure to snap it closed when you're done sipping to seal the leak-proof lid. Plus, the textured pattern makes it a stylish, reusable water bottle around the office in the afternoon. Thanks to Thermalock Vacuum insulation, your new all-day companion keeps liquids hot up to 7 hours or cold up to 16. Comes in a 2 Pack of 20-Ounce mugs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yqQmkRBGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Contigo","source_asin":"B08PWJ81FB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-747135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PWJ81FB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PWJ81FB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
