window.products.push({"id":747424,"name":"Rubbermaid Durable Round 1.6-Gallon Food Storage Container","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HR5PZQ0CL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Rubbermaid® Durable food savers are long lasting and designed to withstand the rigors of your kitchen for reliable food storage.  That is because Rubbermaid® Durable food savers are made of thick plastic that can handle repeated use in the microwave, dishwasher and freezer.  So they're perfect for storing and reheating leftovers.  And the lids and bases stack and nest for simple, compact storage.  Rubbermaid® Durable food savers are long lasting and versatile enough to trust them everyday. Amazon.com The Durable line of Rubbermaid food storage containers is designed to stack securely when full of flour, sugar, cookies, cereal, and more. The base of the upper container nests into the recessed lid of the container underneath, preventing slipping and sliding on the shelf. Made of thick, long-lasting plastic, the food savers may be used to freeze liquids and solids without fear of cracking, and can safely reheat leftovers in the microwave. After use, they wash up clean as a whistle in the dishwasher. Designed with clear sides so you can see what's inside, Durable food savers come in a choice of shape, size, and lid color. This round container holds approximately 1-1/2 gallons, ideal for refrigerating prepped party foods, transporting a large salad to a picnic, or keeping crackers crisp and dry in the cupboard. The airtight lid pries off easily thanks to a tab on the lid that lines up with a notch in the wide rim of the base. A set of Durable food savers makes an excellent gift for a growing family or a student or couple just setting up a new kitchen. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HR5PZQ0CL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rubbermaid","source_asin":"B0000E2GYZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-747424","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000E2GYZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000E2GYZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
