window.products.push({"id":747596,"name":"SmartJars® Pegboard Organizer Accessories Storage Jars, Pegboard Jars for Garage Organization, Craft Room, or Pantry, Pegboard Bins with Lids, Pegboar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fB6RUJHLL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"In three simple steps, items go from distributed clutter to organized and elegant: 1. You put your items in a SmartJar, 2. You snap the SmartJar Dock on to pegboard, 3. You put the SmartJar in to the Dock. Orderly. Easy to find. Laid out just the way you want. When stowed, the SmartJar gives you an easy view of whatever you decide to store in it. The docks are easily inserted and removed in a standard pegboard. SmartJars are transparent, air-tight, durable, and food-safe (BPA free.) Each SmartJar comes with a jar, lid and dock. The jar is a clear cylindrical container, 2½ inches in diameter and 4½ inches tall, with a clear, snap tight lid. They're just big enough for little hands to get in and will hold up to 1¼ cups (10 fluid oz.) The container is placed in the dock on its side so you can look through the lid to see what you have. You can also place a label on the lid for quick reference. On the pegboard, the dock takes up 3 inches by 3 inches and can be arranged directly adjacent to each other, either vertically or horizontally. The docks are currently available in black, blue, gray, red, white, and yellow. SmartJars are 100% Made in the USA. **Please Note Pegboard Compatibility: The SmartJar Dock is designed to snap easily and securely into standard pegboard measuring between 1/8\" to 3/16\" thick, with 1/4\" diameter holes on 1\" spacing. Standard pegboard is widely available on Amazon.com and other large retailers. This product is not compatible with thin, metal pegboard or pegboard panels with smaller holes like those offered by Crawford or Wall Control. Please visit SmartJars.com for our preferred list of compatible pegboards.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fB6RUJHLL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SmartJars","source_asin":"B00NI1XA82","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-747596","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NI1XA82","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NI1XA82","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
