window.products.push({"id":747836,"name":"T-fal G9170564 C92105 Initiatives Nonstick Ceramic Coating PTFE PFOA and Cadmium, 11.5 In, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zLKZ9s52L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"T-fal Initiatives Ceramic cookware has a new, beautiful grey cooking surface and still makes it easier than ever to cook healthier, nutritious and delicious meals at home. The cookware’s heavy-gauge aluminum construction and even heat base offer durable strength, efficient cooking and even heat distribution for reliably consistent results. Recyclable and PTFE-, PFOA-, and Cadmium-free, the cookware’s innovative grey ceramic nonstick interior provides easy food release with just a little oil and can handle high cooking-surface temperatures up to 570°F—perfect for searing meat, fish, poultry, and more to delicious perfection. The ultra durable ceramic interior resists scratches and staining, ensuring high quality performance and long lasting good looks. Ergonomically designed heat resistant handles provide a comfortable and secure grip and are oven safe to 350°F (use an oven mitt), while vented, tempered-glass lids offer at-a-glance monitoring. Dishwasher safe, the cookware cleans up in a flash—no messy overnight soaking required. With its high gloss exterior and beautiful grey interior, T-fal Initiatives Ceramic cookware makes a great gift idea for newlyweds, new homeowners, or anyone looking for a durable and stylish collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zLKZ9s52L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"T-fal","source_asin":"B00IWSQNGM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-747836","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IWSQNGM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IWSQNGM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":747837,"name":"The Oliver Gal Artist Co. People and Portraits Wall Art Canvas Prints 'Bubble Gum and Diamonds' Home Décor, 16 in x 24 in, Blue, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.14,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SHjIqwWcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stunning contemporary blue and black people and portraits wall art for living room and other home or office areas. Captivating portrait pictures for walls make also a great living room wall décor accent. Get it Fast and Flawless Our luxury wall art is carefully wrapped with a layer of shrink-wrap that protects the surface and then wrapped with heavy-duty bubble wrap. Shipped inside a double-layered cardboard box, ensuring its safe arrival to its new home. Masterpiece Designs Admire this sublime portrait canvas that has been captured by a true artist. These home décor wall art pieces add interest and sophistication while helping you bring a contemporary and vibrant theme together serving as wall decorations for bedroom and other areas in your home or office. Perfect for Any Room Our pieces make the perfect wall art for living room, office and bathroom decor with many designs that can make a small space feel refreshed and a large space feel relaxing and inviting through interesting wall portraits. Easy and Secure Hanging Includes all necessary hanging hardware, you'll have your chic fashion piece secured on the wall in minutes! Decorate Like a Celebrity Oliver Gal is renowned for its modern take on portraiture and has been featured by numerous publications including People, Cosmopolitan Magazine, Seventeen Magazine, US Magazine, Reader's Digest, Vogue, and InStyle. Awarded American Quality and Design These canvas prints wall art piece is pridefully designed and manufactured in the USA by real artists and award-winning designers and includes a certificate of authenticity by the artist. Support a Women-Owned Business Oliver Gal is a lifestyle brand spearheaded by sisters and artists Lola and Ana, devoted to bringing you exclusive art pieces created to capture life's most haute moments. Long Lasting, Maintenance Free So easy to maintain, doesn't require any cleaning liquids or water, just use a soft dust brush to gently remove dust when needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SHjIqwWcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Oliver Gal Artist Co.","source_asin":"B07TH43R4J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-747837","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TH43R4J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TH43R4J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
