window.products.push({"id":747931,"name":"Crock-Pot SCCPVL400-S 4-Quart Cook and Carry Slow Cooker, Stainless Steel (Renewed)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81otC-dlvTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This pre-owned or refurbished product has been professionally inspected and tested to work and look like new. How a product becomes part of Amazon Renewed, your destination for pre-owned, refurbished products: A customer buys a new product and returns it or trades it in for a newer or different model. That product is inspected and tested to work and look like new by Amazon-qualified suppliers. Then, the product is sold as an Amazon Renewed product on Amazon. If not satisfied with the purchase, renewed products are eligible for replacement or refund under the Amazon Renewed Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81otC-dlvTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B07QM4KLBD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-747931","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QM4KLBD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QM4KLBD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":747932,"name":"InPlace Shelving 0191409 Warwick Floating Wall Mountable Shelf with Invisible Bracket, Black, 18-Inch Wide by 8-Inch Deep by 1.25-Inch High","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41cTDnck6EL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description Organize your home and free countertops from clutter with this stylish shelf. This floating shelf with invisible floating shelf brackets has a beautiful black color and finish. The shelf measures 18\" wide x 8\" deep x 1.25\" high, and has a load capacity of 10 lbs.These shelves are simple to install and all mounting hardware and instructions are included. They hang on walls with no visible screws, connectors, or tracks. These shelves pair beautifully with rustic, farmhouse, beach, or spa design themes. These floating shelves offer attractive storage space for laundry rooms, mud rooms, kitchens, and more! Buy two or three together to fill empty wall space and display functional items like dishes, pictures, candles, towels, laundry soap, kitchen items, or children's stuffed animals. This shelf will perfectly complement the wall decor in your home.Established in 1930, Hyman Inc. has been built on the principles of quality, service, and innovation. Known for marketing innovative home decor and building products for over 85 years, we provide a wide range of home accessories and improvement products for consumers, pros, and home decorators. Today, Lewis Hyman, Inc. and LH Licensed Products Inc. are jointly marketed as Hyman Inc. Our corporate headquarters in Carson, CA includes a 100,000 square foot distribution facility. Our Atlanta, GA office largely supports our e-commerce business and continues to provide our “quick ship” program to the east coast and the southeastern United States. We currently have showrooms in both office locations to collaborate with our partners and customers from all over the world. Finally, we also offer our trade customers access to these same services from our offices in North Carolina, Portugal, Hong Kong, and Shanghai.Use your Amazon gift card and search our other amazing products at our Amazon storefront. From the Manufacturer Organize your home and free countertops from clutter with the Warwick black floating decorative wall shelf. Traditional in style, this functional wall shelf offers attractive storage space that is perfect for laundry rooms, mud rooms, kitchens, children's bedrooms, or play rooms. Buy two or three to fill an empty wall space and display functional items like towels, laundry soap, kitchen items, or children's stuffed animals. This functional black wall shelf compliments any room and shows no visible support, making it appear to be floating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41cTDnck6EL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"InPlace Shelving","source_asin":"B00KME1012","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-747932","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KME1012","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KME1012","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
