window.products.push({"id":747949,"name":"VEHHE Reusable Straws Metal Straws with Silicone Tips travel Case - Long Drinking Straws for 30 oz and 20 oz Tumblers Yeti Dishwasher Safe - 4 Cleanin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JZe+17GAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"IDEAL SIZE FIT FOR ALL SIZE TUMBLERS: This 16 set metal straws including 4 straight straws 4 bent straws of 10.5\" and 4 straight straws 4 bent straws of 8.5\",4 cleaning brush for 20oz tumblers or 30oz tumblers. Perfect for you to enjoy your cold bevarage, sipping cocktail, coffee, ice tea, cappuccino etc. TOP FOOD-GRADE 304 STAINLESS STEEL：This metal straws with silicone tip is made of top food grade 304 stainless steel, this reusable straws are the natural choice for everyone, which is BPA free, plastic free, no metal aftertaste, no oxidation, colorfast, dishwasher safe, reusable and environmentally friendly. One set of reusable straw can be used for years to come - replacing hundreds or thousands of plastic straws. SILICONE TIPS FOR SAFER DRINKING :Each of stainless steel straws comes with a silicone tip. These silicone tips are made of food-grade silicone, which is food grade and non-toxic can be directly contacted with the mouth. These soft thick silicone tips will protect your lips and teeth from getting too cold or too hot. So you don’t have to worry about hurting your mouth and teeth. 4 FREE SCRUB BRUSH & EASY TO CLEAN: This straws reusable come with 4 special scrub brush, the brush is of the perfect size for these straws, you just need to hold the handle of the brush and let nylon bristles come into the straws. This straws is also dishwasher safe and will not fade, rust, bend or scratch. PERFECT GIFT FOR FAMILES : This 16 set reusable straws with silicone tips comes with a portable storge bag and a exquisite gift box, so it is also an idea gift for you to send your families or friends on Mother's Day, Christmas, New Year, Housewarming, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JZe+17GAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEHHE","source_asin":"B08XXJ1LZL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-747949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XXJ1LZL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XXJ1LZL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
